        "observed": "Inspected complete 960×720 aerial photograph. Rectangular pale-stone mosque, open front court with rows of grey cap domes, two slim double-balcony minarets, tall central dome and four stepped semidome masses with lower corner caps. Courtyard fountain has a polygonal pointed grey canopy. Surrounding medreses, gardens and tombs are separate context."
