        "observed": "Inspected complete 960×639 courtyard photograph. Pale round columns and pointed arches with alternating muted red/cream wedge borders; a taller middle entrance bay; rows of grey domes and two minarets with two balcony rings and pointed dark roofs. Polygonal fountain canopy has broad eaves, a raised pointed center and slim pale supports. Fine carving, calligraphy, lattices, taps and people are not copied."
